class=\"item\">Photogallery</a></li><li class=\"item\"><a href=\"/en/price-list/\" class=\"item\">Price list</a></li></ul></li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"/en/restaurant/\" class=\"item\">Restaurant</a>\n</li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"/en/weddings/\" class=\"item\">Weddings</a>\n</li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"/en/conference/\" class=\"item\">Conference</a>\n</li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"/en/reviews/\" class=\"item\">References</a>\n</li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"/en/contact/\" class=\"item\">Contact</a>\n</li><li class=\"item lineone\"><a href=\"#pll_switcher\" class=\"item\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"English\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\"></a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\"><li class=\"item\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"item\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Čeština\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\"></a></li><li class=\"item\"><a href=\"/en/home/\" class=\"item\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"English\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\"></a></li><li class=\"item last\"><a href=\"/de/hotel-magnolia/\" class=\"item\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Deutsch\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\"></a></li></ul></li></ul></nav>                                                   \n                </div></div>\n               \n     \t\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <div class=\"slider\">\n                \n            <div id=\"metaslider-id-2808\" style=\"width: 100%;\" class=\"ml-slider-3-40-0 metaslider metaslider-flex metaslider-2808 ml-slider ms-theme-default nav-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"Slideshow\" aria-label=\"home\">\n    <div id=\"metaslider_container_2808\">\n        <div id=\"metaslider_2808\">\n            <ul aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"slides\">\n                <li style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" class=\"slide-2809 ms-image\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"slide-2809\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5417f_resize-2-1920x750.jpg\" height=\"750\" width=\"1920\" alt=\"\" class=\"slider-2808 slide-2809\" title=\"_ANK5417f_resize-2\"><div class=\"caption-wrap\"><div class=\"caption\"></div></div></li>\n                <li style=\"display: none; width: 100%;\" class=\"slide-2830 ms-image\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"slide-2830\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5417f_resize-2-1920x750.jpg\" height=\"750\" width=\"1920\" alt=\"\" class=\"slider-2808 slide-2830\" title=\"_ANK5417f_resize-2\"></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>                  \n       \n        \t\t</div>\n                \n        </header>\n\t                                                 \n\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n  \n                                             \n   \n             \n                                  \n  <h1 class=\"entry-title\">\n      Hotel Magnolia  <span></span></h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"entry-content\">\n      \n      <div class=\"top_onas\"><p>Hotel Magnolia is located in the picturesque town of Roudnice nad Labem with an 800-year tradition. The hotel itself was built around the 14th century.</p>\n<p>Due to numerous fires, the building was reconstructed several times, up to its current form. During the 16th century, the building was the most prominent house in Roudnice nad Labem.</p>\n<p>Currently, the Magnolia Hotel (formerly the Vavřinec Hotel) has 38&nbsp;rooms, a restaurant and a congress hall.</p>\n</div>                                           \n\n\t\n  </div>\n   \n  <div class=\"kategorie_menu\">\n          </div>\n                        \n  <div class=\"entry-content2\">\n      <div class=\"upravy_obsah\"><div id=\"radek_0\" class=\"barva_1\"><ul class=\"sirein\"><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_0\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2>38&nbsp;cosy rooms</h2>\n<p>The 38&nbsp;cosy and comfortably furnished rooms are divided into 29&nbsp;double rooms and 1&nbsp;single room. For more demanding guests there are 3&nbsp;suites. Classic room amenities include private bathroom and TV. In the rooms you have the possibility to connect to the Internet.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_1\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2854 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_2\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2865 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5450f_resize-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5450f_resize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5450f_resize-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5450f_resize-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5450f_resize.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_3\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2>Hotel Magnolia *** in the heart of the city</h2>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-ta tw-text-small\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Překlad\">Hotel Magnolia is located directly on the main square of Roudnice nad Labem. From the hotel you can enjoy a beautiful view of the castle.</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_4\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">Conference hall and weddings</h2>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-ta tw-text-small\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Překlad\">Hotel Magnolia is a great place for your wedding or corporate event. The spacious hall can accommodate up to a hundred participants and can be reconfigured to suit your requirements. There is also a restaurant with a bar in the adjoining rooms.</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_5\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-large wp-image-2858 alignleft\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5226f_resize-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5226f_resize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5226f_resize-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5226f_resize-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5226f_resize.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li></ul></div><div class=\"nextsession\"></div></div>                             \n\n\n  </div>                                \n  \n  <div class=\"dva_boxy_in_obsah2\"> \n  <div class=\"dva_boxy_in_obsah_prava2\">                  \n          <h2>Reference<span></span></h2>\n          <div class=\"slide-top2 slide-top-home2\">                    \n                  <input name=\"slidnum\" val=\"0\" hidden=\"\">                                                    \n                  <div class=\"slide-top-in2\">\n                          <div class=\"slide-top-list2\">\n                                                       <div class=\"slide-top-item2\"><a href=\"/reference/\">\n                                  <div class=\"obr\"><img width=\"117\" height=\"117\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-117x117.jpg\" class=\"attachment-reference2 size-reference2\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-117x117.jpg 117w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-150x150.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-200x200.jpg 200w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-330x330.jpg 330w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5511-copy_resize-400x400.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 117px) 100vw, 117px\"></div>\n                                  <div class=\"slide-box2\">\n                                          <h3 class=\"title_homenews2\">Jana K.</h3>\n                                          <div class=\"content_home_news2\">Úžasný a milý personál, krásné prostředí, byly jsme moc spokojeni.  ...</div>\n                                  </div>\n                            </a></div><div class=\"slide-top-item2\"><a href=\"/reference/\">\n                                  <div class=\"obr\"><img width=\"117\" height=\"117\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-117x117.jpg\" class=\"attachment-reference2 size-reference2\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-117x117.jpg 117w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-150x150.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-200x200.jpg 200w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-330x330.jpg 330w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5524-copy_resize-400x400.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 117px) 100vw, 117px\"></div>\n                                  <div class=\"slide-box2\">\n                                          <h3 class=\"title_homenews2\">Zuzana</h3>\n                                          <div class=\"content_home_news2\">„Krasný hotel přívětivý personál, vyšlo i počasí a pobyt jsme si užili, když bude možnost rádi se vrátíme.“ ...</div>\n                                  </di